<section class="repair-card"><h2>Restore files to your existing songs</h2><p>Upload replacement listening audio without creating duplicate songs. Titles, artwork links, playlists, listening history and Studio records stay attached to the same IDs. Add REAPER projects and exported stems separately.</p><div class="repair-actions"><a class="repair-btn <?= !$all?'primary':'' ?>" href="<?= e($self) ?>">Missing files · <?= $missing ?></a><a class="repair-btn <?= $all?'primary':'' ?>" href="<?= e($self.'&view=all') ?>">All checked songs · <?= count($inventory) ?></a><a class="repair-btn" href="<?= e(url('/music-library.php?workspace='.$workspaceId)) ?>">Music Library</a></div><p class="repair-note">Checks the first 200 Library records and 200 production records in this workspace, including authorized legacy songs. This checks saved file locations; it does not scan backups or delete records.</p></section>
<?php if($selected&&!($selected['blocked']??false)): ?><section class="repair-card" id="replace-audio"><h2>Replace audio: <?= e((string)$selected['song']['title']) ?></h2><p>Current listening master: <strong><?= e($selected['master']['label']) ?></strong>. Choose the exported full song mix, not an RPP or an individual stem. Existing physical files are retained.</p><form class="repair-form" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" action="<?= e(url('/api/music-file-repair.php')) ?>"><?= csrf_field() ?><input type="hidden" name="workspace_id" value="<?= $workspaceId ?>"><input type="hidden" name="kind" value="<?= e($selected['kind']) ?>"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<?= (int)$selected['id'] ?>"><input type="hidden" name="revision" value="<?= e($selected['revision']) ?>"><label>Replacement listening audio<input type="file" name="audio_file" accept=".mp3,.m4a,.wav,.ogg,audio/*" required></label><p class="repair-note">MP3, M4A, WAV or OGG. The upload is validated before the song’s file link is updated. This does not publish a draft or replace its project stems.</p><button class="repair-btn primary" type="submit">Save replacement audio</button></form></section><?php elseif($id>0): ?><section class="repair-card"><p class="repair-alert">This song could not be selected for replacement. Review its Studio link or choose it from the list below.</p></section><?php endif; ?>
